This repository builds on third-party software and data:

- pal_mjlab (PAL Robotics): Kangaroo model and mjlab integration, Apache License 2.0.
  https://github.com/pal-robotics/pal_mjlab
- LIBERO: MIT License. https://github.com/Lifelong-Robot-Learning/LIBERO
- robosuite v1.5.2: the water bottle asset (bottle.xml, mesh, texture), MIT License.
  https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite
- Google Scanned Objects, via https://github.com/kevinzakka/mujoco_scanned_objects (repo MIT;
  models CC-BY 4.0, (c) Google Research). Used models:
  "Cole_Hardware_Mug_Classic_Blue" (cup) and "Threshold_Bead_Cereal_Bowl_White" (bowl).
- Seated setup: seated_setup_for_libero (seated_setup.json, version 2026-10-19).
